WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:05.480
Hey youtubers it's Charlie. Yesterday I asked
you all to submit your Arrow and Flash questions

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.630
so I picked 10 of them to answer in this video
with one bonus question. There were a ton

00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:16.670
of Hong Kong Amanda Waller questions. Since
Stephen Amell has started talking about Season

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.960
3 we've gotten some good teasers for what's
going to be happening.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:23.670
Real quick, if you're finding me for the first
time I do Marvel and DC videos every week.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:28.880
Be sure to subscribe to get everything. I'm
also working on a Special Star Wars video

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.909
for late tonight and I'm seeing Maleficent,
so that review will go up tomorrow.

00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:38.899
Now let's talk about the unholy union of Oliver
and Amanda Waller and Flash whatnot.

00:00:38.899 --> 00:00:44.319
Question 1 - Jedi Knight asks Do you think
we will ever get to see Slade's son in present

00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:45.350
day?﻿

00:00:45.350 --> 00:00:50.559
You're talking about Jericho, I think eventually
yes. Jericho appearing is completely dependent

00:00:50.559 --> 00:00:55.420
on Slade's role on the show. If they use him
as part of a larger story then I think it

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.829
would be a good opportunity to bring him on.
Even if they decide to not feature Slade they

00:00:59.829 --> 00:01:05.379
could always bring on a new character using
a false name and just develop him as a new

00:01:05.379 --> 00:01:06.570
Roy type person.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:12.490
Cut to the end of the season and it's revealed
he's really Slade's son and has no idea what

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:17.250
his father did in season 2 or that Oliver
was responsible for putting him in ARGUS jail.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:21.340
They mentioned him a couple times between
Season 1 and Season 2, so they have to show

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:26.710
him eventually. Or at least tell us what happened
to him after Slade was marooned on the island.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:31.530
I'd really like to know if he ever tried to
contact him after he escaped. He was pretty

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:35.380
juiced up though. So I wouldn't be surprised
if he did not.

00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:40.979
Question 2 - Jaimer asks Where will Slade's
powers and enhanced brain function go? and

00:01:40.979 --> 00:01:47.149
will they use the metahuman plot on The Flash
show to give Laurel real Black Canary powers?

00:01:47.149 --> 00:01:52.590
When the mirakuru in his blood was neutralized
all of the benefits went away too. The mirakuru

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:58.700
was mostly a regenerative drug that also gave
people super strength. It didn't make Slade

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:03.740
super smart like he is in the comics. They
changed all that. He's still really clever,

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:08.350
but the only mental side effects of the drug
were negative ones, making him hallucinate

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:09.300
Shado.

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:13.530
And no I don't think Laurel is going to become
a metahuman. Even if she did, they would do

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:18.130
it on Arrow, not the Flash. The crossover
material that they do for Arrow and Flash

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:21.280
will be more driven by trying to defeat a
villain.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:27.660
It's unclear how Oliver is going to get involved
in the Reactor Explosion Dark Energy plot

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.680
that they teased in the Flash Trailer. I would
guess that if you were not in the blast radius,

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:34.490
you're not getting super powers from that.
So all the new metahumans will just be people

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:40.490
in Central City when that happened.

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:45.710
Question 3 - cocotiks (no avatar) asks Since
Oliver is in Hong Kong will we get new characters

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:47.190
in the flashbacks?

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:52.440
Totally, I'm expecting too see new and familiar
faces. As for who some of those characters

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:56.920
might be, I think it will mostly be international
superheroes and villains. Otherwise why make

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:01.490
it all happen in Hong Kong, it's such a port
of call on that side of the world. Naturally

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:05.690
a lot of the criminal elements of the DC Universe
would pass through there at some point.

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:10.930
Amanda Waller as teased in season 1 was mostly
there to destabilize the Chinese government.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:16.230
Presumably, the Hong Kong flashbacks will
spell out why and what else she was up to.

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:21.240
Question 4 - Malicious asks Do you think Komodo
or Onomatopoeia is going to be a major or

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.760
minor villain in Arrow season 3?﻿

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:29.450
I think Komodo is more likely, but they gave
a lot of his character traits and history

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:35.280
to Slade in Season 2. Like in the comics,
Komodo creates a plan to make Oliver lose

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:38.490
all his money and Oliver shoots one of his
eyes out with an Arrow. So they've already

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:41.620
combined the character with Deathstroke.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:45.250
But it's totally possible that they could
use the character and just change the backstory

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.800
to focus more on his history with Shado.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:52.530
If you're not familiar with Komodo, his real
name is Simon Lacroix and he grew up working

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:58.480
for Queen Industries, learned archery from
Oliver's father Robert Queen and turned evil.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:04:03.530
Question 5 - Jhon Harper asks do you think
that John Diggle will become a green lantern?

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:07.980
If not do you think that green lantern will
be in arrow or flash?﻿

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:14.980
I don't think they'd do something as big as
that without a multi season arc. And just

00:04:17.709 --> 00:04:22.190
because Hal Jordan is the most iconic Green
Lantern, I think the Flash TV Show would get

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:27.490
first crack at teasing the character, just
because Jordan is also a Central City character.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:32.540
They've teased Ferris Airlines before, so
I think we'll see more Green Lantern teasers.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:37.260
If they do anything Diggle related with Green
Lantern, it will just be having him make some

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:42.130
jokes about Green costumes, rings or have
him rhyme something like the Green Lantern

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:42.980
motto.

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:46.910
In terms of actually seeing a Green Lantern
character on either show, I think definitely

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:52.340
eventually. The Green Lantern movie flopped,
so Warner Bros probably won't have a problem

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:59.340
demoting the character to TV status. But it
took 2 years to get to Barry Allen, so don't

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:09.470
expect another spinoff character like that
till Arrow Season 4 or The Flash Season 2.

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:13.030
Question 6 - Jack Gutman (no avatar) asks
Hey Charlie how 'bout a shoutout, my Birthday

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.160
is on Saturday?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.340
Everybody be sure to give Jack a Birthday
high five!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:23.800
Question 7 - Daedelus (no avatar) asks what
other non natural abilities or powers will

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.889
appear on Arrow?﻿

00:05:25.889 --> 00:05:30.050
It looks like they've been able to do a pretty
good job with weather and energy based special

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.980
effects, just looking at the Flash Trailer.
But because Oliver isn't a superhuman. They're

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:39.280
probably going to steer away from comic book
characters with crazy powers. It makes more

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.889
sense to put Oliver next to other characters
of similar ability.

00:05:42.889 --> 00:05:48.470
There's always exceptions. The only one right
now is named Barry Allen. And he'll only be

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:51.139
next to Oliver on screen a couple of times
this year.

00:05:51.139 --> 00:05:56.740
The Flash is a whole different story. Because
he's got crazy powers via Speedforce those

00:05:56.740 --> 00:06:03.150
limitations you have with Oliver are out the
window. Just because I'm a sucker for the

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.880
classics, I'd say the first other super powers
we'll see will be Rogue based powers. Like

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:10.000
Captain Cold freezing stuff.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.800
Question 8 - Adrian (no avatar) asks do you
think we'll see the league of assassins in

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.790
the hong kong flashbacks?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:19.380
That would be so awesome. I definitely think
we'll see references to them. But I don't

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:23.880
think they'll be the primary antagonist, like
Ed Fyers was on the island. Oliver did say

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:28.040
that he heard 'things' about Ra's Al Ghul,
so he had to hear them from somewhere. It's

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:32.330
stands to reason that place could have been
Hong Kong.

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:36.910
Question 9 - Niloy (no avatar) asks is there
going to be any reference flashpoint storyline

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.139
on the flash tv series?

00:06:39.139 --> 00:06:42.480
So they're starting the show off using a modified
version of the Flash Rebirth story and the

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:47.910
new 52 Origin story. Geoff Johns is on the
writing staff and he wrote Flash for a long

00:06:47.910 --> 00:06:53.270
time, so expect lots of references to golden
age, silver age and recent Flash stuff. Flashpoint

00:06:53.270 --> 00:06:54.570
included.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:59.500
But since Flashpoint was such a universe altering
event, I think they'll just make references

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:03.960
to it. The Particle Accelerator Explosion
is kind of the macguffin for season 1, the

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:08.230
dark energy it releases creating all the new
metahumans is going to be where they mine

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:15.180
most of the story from week to week.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:19.560
Question 10 - Alex Garcia asks, do you think
we'll see Felicity Flashbacks from before

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.850
she met Oliver

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:26.870
Originally when Stephen Amell talked about
learning more about Felicity in Season 2 he

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:31.530
made it sound like we were supposed to get
way more info and it just got edited out at

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:38.130
the last minute. I don't expect a lot of Flashbacks
like we get with Hong Kong and the Island,

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:43.600
but I do think Felicity will start talking
about her past before she met everyone. Or

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.919
talk about it more.

00:07:45.919 --> 00:07:51.949
Usually it takes something traumatic for that
to happen. So I think something will happen

00:07:51.949 --> 00:07:56.449
with her family that will make her want to
talk to Oliver about it. And that's when we

00:07:56.449 --> 00:07:59.860
learn more. I don't think she's going to get
any solo episodes where she goes off on her

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:06.860
own without Team Arrow for an entire hour.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:15.650
Bonus Question - LordLaxton (no avatar) asks,
do you think they'll introduce a new supervillain

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:20.490
in season 3 like they in season 2 when they
did Barry Allen?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:25.680
So you're asking about them bringing a major
character into the Arrowverse, like someone

00:08:25.680 --> 00:08:32.279
big enough to get a spinoff. I think they'll
definitely bring someone in who can stand

00:08:32.279 --> 00:08:37.309
by themselves. They'd have to, just to top
Deathstroke. I think whoever it ends up being

00:08:37.309 --> 00:08:42.740
will be a lateral move, like they're not going
to get a supervillain with real super powers.

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:47.749
It will be someone like Deathstroke or Merlyn
who Oliver actually has a chance of defeating,

00:08:47.749 --> 00:08:49.839
with a little help from Felicity of course.

00:08:49.839 --> 00:08:54.670
I'm sure Stephen Amell will be talking more
about the new villain at Comic Con this summer.

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.529
So that's probably when we'll get more teasers.

00:08:57.529 --> 00:09:00.029
So thanks so much for submitting questions
everyone! These are always a ton of fun to

00:09:00.029 --> 00:09:03.519
do. I'll be posting my next Arrow and Flash
videos next Wednesday, so be sure to subscribe

00:09:03.519 --> 00:09:06.379
to get everything. And feel free to leave
me suggestions for bonus topics.

